   "widgets_values": [
    "HaDeS MOSS Suite - Basic Generation (the first video tutorial)\n\nMOSS Loader: MOSS-Image Base, the Qwen3.5 9B int8 text encoder and the FLUX.2 VAE.\nMOSS Prompt Enhancer, 'as written': your sentence is the prompt.\nMOSS KSampler: 25 steps, CFG 2.5, euler / simple when the turbo input is empty.\nMOSS Turbo LoRA (Turbo 8-steps v1.0, trained for Base): 8 steps, CFG 1, euler / simple.\n   For 25 steps again: switch the turbo node off or unplug its wire.\n   With HaDeS MOSS v1.0 Turbo as the model, leave the turbo input empty: it is baked in.\n\nModels: the turbo LoRA in models/loras (huggingface.co/DeVilDoNia/HaDeS-MOSS-Turbo).\nSeed 1013 in MOSS Latent is the video's; set its after run to randomize for new images."
